# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Environment
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Copy to `.env.local` and adjust. Vite reads `.env`, `.env.local` and the
# mode-specific variants. Values are inlined at BUILD time, so changing one
# requires a rebuild — it is not read at runtime.
#
# Only variables prefixed `VITE_` are exposed to browser code. Never put a
# secret here: everything below is public.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# Origin of the contact API, WITHOUT a trailing slash.
#
#   VITE_API_BASE_URL=https://api.afghanfutian.com
#     → the form posts to https://api.afghanfutian.com/api/contact
#
#   (unset, the default)
#     → the form posts to /api/contact on the site's own origin, which is what a
#       reverse-proxied deployment wants.
#
# The full request/response contract is documented in src/lib/api.js.
VITE_API_BASE_URL=
